+| decide-kev-9b | Kev-9B Q4_K_M (86a60849) | systemone-native | 132/132 | 0.967 [0.886,0.991] (0.667) | 1.000 [0.914,1.000] (0.235) | 0.710 [0.534,0.839] (0.290) | 4.6 s |
